<title>UK: Pemex prices $300 million three-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Pemex prices $300 million three-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Petroleos Mexicanos' $300 million</p>
<p>three-year Eurobond has been priced, lead manager UBS Ltd said.</p>
<p>+ + +</p>
<p> AMT	  $300 MLN  COUPON     7.75	MATURITY    29.OCT.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.80     PAY DATE    29.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.375     REOFFER    99.80     SPREAD	+175 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	BA2	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  BB	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/MX</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
